--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 710e1bac7a011e4d458ef6c347ab4156, type: 3}
  m_Name: Call_AfterCartelMeeting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: 'Oof, out of the frying pan... '
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: The RV's about as mobile as my Nan, and they know that. It seems you've got no other options here - you'll have to meet their demands or suffer the consequences.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: But you should be able to produce more product than what they're demanding, so you can continue selling to your customers and making money.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: The next step will be buying a new property - somewhere the Benzies family won't find you. Then you'll be in a position to break off this 'agreement'.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: So at least there's a light at the end of the tunnel. Keep doing what you're doing, and start saving for your first property.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
